# Nightly machine upkeep (local-maintenance): pending macOS/App Store
# updates, backup freshness, cert expiry, disk space, log rotation, and a
# Sunday docker prune. Findings are emailed by maintenance.sh itself; this
# job only exits 1 when that email could not be delivered, so the failure
# notification (banner + ntfy push) covers a lost report.
JOB_SCHEDULE="45 3 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="sh \"$ROOT/../local-maintenance/maintenance.sh\" run"
